  "description": "Tight EDM string stab: detuned saws, a narrow pulse and an octave saw with a 4 ms attack and a fast, resonant filter pluck. Play C3–C5 in 3–4-note chords on eighth or sixteenth gates of 60–150 ms; velocity drives the filter bite (velSens 0.6), mod wheel opens the filter. Mixer: chorus rate 0.8 Hz, depth 1.5 ms, spread 0.8, mix 0.3; a short plate at send 0.2 or the dotted echo at 0.3; low cut 90 Hz; sidechain the compressor to the kick.",
