  "description": "Slow ambient strings that change while held: a saw pair swells in over three seconds, a sine modulator blooms brightness over six, a drifting LFO moves pitch and the modulators, and the lowpass opens over eight. Hold C2–C5 in sparse 2–4-note voicings for 8 s or longer — the gesture is the swell; mod wheel opens the filter further and deepens the drift. Mixer: chorus rate 0.15 Hz, depth 3 ms, spread 1, mix 0.5; plate send 0.55 with a long decay; low cut 50 Hz.",
