  "description": "Solina / ARP String Ensemble: phase-locked divider saws and pulses in viola, violin (8+4 ft) and cello (16 ft) footages behind a gentle 12 dB lowpass; the animation belongs to the chorus, so spread is small. Ensemble pad — play C3–C5 in 3–4-note chords, gate 1 s or longer; mod wheel adds vibrato and opens the filter. Mixer: the ensemble insert on its Solina preset (three delay lines 120° apart, each swept by the 0.6 Hz slow and 6 Hz fast LFOs; tone 12 kHz; width 1, mix 1); low cut 120 Hz; plate send 0.25.",
