  "description": "Oberheim OB-Xa strings: two detuned saws and a pulse per voice with an octave saw for the OB shimmer, into a 24 dB lowpass whose slow envelope opens over the first second. Wide, warm ensemble pad — play C2–C5 in 3–4-note chords (a 6-note chord fills the part with spread), gate 1.5 s or longer; velocity brightens, mod wheel adds vibrato and opens the filter. Mixer: chorus rate 0.35 Hz, depth 2.5 ms, spread 0.8, mix 0.4; low cut 60 Hz; plate send 0.3.",
