  "description": "Roland Juno-60/106 strings: one saw, a 50 % pulse, a square sub-oscillator and a true PWM pulse whose duty LFO 2 sweeps 0.2–0.8 at 0.5 Hz, into the 24 dB lowpass. Classic chorused synth strings — play C3–C5 in triads and 4-note chords, gate 1 s or longer; the mod wheel adds a touch of vibrato. Mixer: the Juno chorus II is chorus rate 0.86 Hz, depth 3.5 ms, spread 1, mix 0.5 (chorus I: rate 0.5 Hz, depth 2 ms); low cut 40 Hz; plate send 0.2.",
